B.JK=new A.aD("I've also used the project as a teaching ground for my colleague Mathias.",!1)
B.JL=new A.aD("I had tiny experience with Java and Android before starting at the company, and I remember I was given a Mac some days before my first day, so I could learn Objective-C and familiarize myself with macOS (ain't nothing scaring me).",!1)
B.JM=new A.aD("Our group of 4 spent 24h writing an app that helped students to move around our (Faculty of Mathematics and Information Science's) building.",!1)
